   "text": "[Point 05 (English Journey) — Initial Walk-In]\nStrategy: Build rapport, observe the customer's and student's reactions, then draw out the answers that surface naturally.\nUseful questions:\n- \"From this placement result, let me help explain [name]'s starting point, Mom.\"\n- \"This part shows their current ability. What's the next target you'd like to reach?\"\n- \"May I show you the CEFR so the level is easier to picture?\"\nDig deeper: Use the CEFR Guide to make the level easier to understand. Connect the current level to the goal, not just show a score.\n\n### Point 05 (English Journey) — Initial Phone Call"
