   "s": 0,
   "loc": "Point 06 (Success Target Timeline) — Initial Walk-In…",
   "text": "[Point 06 (Success Target Timeline) — Initial Walk-In]\nStrategy: Once the target is clear, ask when the student wants to see results or reach that milestone.\nUseful questions:\n- When do you want to start seeing noticeable progress?\n- Is there a deadline or particular moment that makes this target important?\n- When we set the target, what do you want to be able to do by that time?\nDig deeper: Turn an answer of 'as soon as possible' into a more concrete and realistic milestone.\n\n### Point 06 (Success Target Timeline) — Initial Phone Call\n\nStrategy: Explore the urgency and deadline behind the target so the advisor can see a realistic learning timeline.\nUseful questions:\n- When do you want to start feeling progress?\n- Is there an event, exam, school, university, travel, or work need that sets a deadline?\n- By that time, what do you want your English ability to look like?\nDig deeper: If there's no deadline, help the customer set a milestone that makes sense.\n\n### Point 06 (Success Target Timeline) — Initial Chat"
