   "text": "[Point 07 (Possible Schedule) — Initial Walk-In]\nStrategy: Build rapport, observe the customer's and student's reactions, then draw out the answers that surface naturally.\nUseful questions:\n- \"Looking at [name]'s routine, which day is usually the most realistic for learning?\"\n- \"After school, are there tutoring sessions or other activities?\"\n- \"For the time, is late afternoon or evening more comfortable, Mom?\"\nDig deeper: Match availability to the real routine: school, work, activities, travel, and parent availability. Avoid assuming a \"free slot\" automatically means they're ready to learn.\n\n### Point 07 (Possible Schedule) — Initial Phone Call"
